Loss on a filter-normalized 2D slice through the trained minimum (star, at the origin by construction). A clean, roughly convex-looking bowl around this particular minimum -- log-scaled color since the loss climbs several orders of magnitude away from the minimum, the same compression fig-contour uses back in Chapter 1.
